DeepGEMM — https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM
Copyright (c) 2025 DeepSeek
License: MIT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The routed-expert relaxed-path bodies (execute_w13_dg / execute_w2_dg in
deepspec/megakernel/csrc/dspark_w13_phase.cuh) adapt the SM100 FP8/FP4
block-scaled GEMM structure and device helpers from DeepGEMM commit
559d79fb6994a58b8a15b4b93bf13ccc16edf247:
sm100_fp8_fp4_gemm_1d1d (tensor-memory-resident UE8M0 scale factors staged
via tcgen05.cp, kind::mxf8f6f4.block_scale UMMAs with per-32/per-128 scale
granularity selected by scale-factor IDs, BLOCK_K=128 pipeline stages, and
a tensor-memory-chained accumulator drained once per output block), plus
adapted forms of make_sf_desc, make_runtime_instr_desc_with_sf_id, and the
SM100_MMA_MXF8F6F4_SS inline-asm wrapper.

